 - \\frac{3x^2}{2}.\\]\n\n\\[f(x) = \\frac{3x^2 + 6x^2 - 6x^2}{2}.\\]\n\n\\[f(x) = \\frac{3x^2 + 6x^2 - 6x^2}{2}.\\]\n\n\\[f(x) = \\boxed{\\frac{6x^2 + 12x + 2}{2}}.\\]",
